SUMMARY:Brisbane Pinball Club
DESCRIPTION:Every fortnight\, the Brisbane Pinball Club meets in the Nether
 world. Each meeting will require you to play 10 different pinball machines
  of the club’s choosing at your own pace. If you’ve ever wanted to joi
 n a Pinball club\, this is your time to shine! It’s open to absolutely e
 verybody and all skill levels. Prizes awarded to the top 8 places and play
 ing will get you an International Flipper Pinball Association (IFPA) ranki
 ng. Head down anytime from 3pm to 7pm to get involved\, with finals happen
 ing from 8.30pm! Entry is $20 with early bird entry of $15 if you make it 
 down by 4pm.
LOCATION:Netherworld\, 186 Brunswick Street
URL:https://www.netherworldarcade.com/event/brisbane-pinball-club/
